TI  - Acute effects of moderate-intensity and high-intensity exercise on hemodynamic and autonomic reactivity to the cold pressor test in young adults with excess body weight
T2  - BLOOD PRESSURE MONITORING
LA  - English
KW  - autonomic dysfunction
KW  - blood pressure
