TI  - Oxygenation Threshold Derived from Near-Infrared Spectroscopy: Reliability and Its Relationship with the First Ventilatory Threshold
T2  - PLOS ONE
LA  - English
KW  - RAMP INCREMENTAL EXERCISE
KW  - ALVEOLAR GAS-EXCHANGE
KW  - MUSCLE BLOOD-FLOW
KW  - SKELETAL-MUSCLE
