TI  - Effects of High-Intensity Hatha Yoga on Cardiovascular Fitness, Adipocytokines, and Apolipoproteins in Healthy Students: A Randomized Controlled Study
T2  - JOURNAL OF ALTERNATIVE AND COMPLEMENTARY MEDICINE
LA  - English
