TI  - PREOPERATIVE HIGH-INTENSITY INTERVAL TRAINING IS EFFECTIVE AND SAFE IN DECONDITIONED PATIENTS WITH LUNG CANCER: A RANDOMIZED CLINICAL TRIAL
