TI  - Effects of 12 weeks of aerobic versus combined aerobic plus resistance exercise training on short-term blood pressure variability in patients with hypertension
T2  - JOURNAL OF APPLIED PHYSIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - aerobic exercise training
KW  - blood pressure variability
