TI  - Hypoxic peripheral chemoreflex stimulation-dependent cardiorespiratory coupling is decreased in swimmer athletes
T2  - PHYSIOLOGICAL REPORTS
LA  - English
KW  - chemoreflex
KW  - coherence
KW  - hypoxia
