TI  - RETRACTED: Increased bronchial parasympathetic tone in elite cross-country and biathlon skiers: a randomised crossover study (Retracted Article)
T2  - BRITISH JOURNAL OF SPORTS MEDICINE
LA  - English
KW  - EXERCISE-INDUCED ASTHMA
KW  - AIRWAY HYPERRESPONSIVENESS
