TI  - Estimation of the workload in horses during an eventing competition
T2  - COMPARATIVE EXERCISE PHYSIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - horse
KW  - work load
KW  - dressage
KW  - show jumping
KW  - cross country
KW  - WARM-UP
