TI  - Towards Machine Learning-Based Detection of Running-Induced Fatigue in Real-World Scenarios: Evaluation of IMU Sensor Configurations to Reduce Intrusiveness
T2  - SENSORS
LA  - English
KW  - fatigue estimation
KW  - biomechanics
