TI  - What Does It Take to Reach the Podium? Power Output and Heart Rate-Derived Racing Demands of Top Cyclists During Grand Tours
T2  - SCANDINAVIAN JOURNAL OF MEDICINE & SCIENCE IN SPORTS
LA  - English
