TI  - High-intensity interval versus moderate-intensity continuous cycling training in Parkinson's disease: a randomized trial
T2  - JOURNAL OF APPLIED PHYSIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - exercise training
KW  - high-intensity interval exercise
KW  - maximal oxygen consumption
KW  - Parkinson's disease
KW  - GAIT ANALYSIS
