TI  - Modeling Post-COVID Respiratory Rehabilitation with Nonlinear Dynamics and Fractal Metrics: Beyond Spirometry
T2  - BALNEO AND PRM RESEARCH JOURNAL
LA  - English
KW  - pulmonary function test
KW  - post-Covid syndrome
KW  - attractor modeling
KW  - bifurcation analysis
KW  - fractal
KW  - dimension
KW  - complex systems physiology
