TI  - A New Surgical Trainer (BOPT) Improves Skill Transfer for Anastomotic Techniques in Gastrointestinal Surgery into the Operating Room: A Prospective Randomized Trial
T2  - WORLD JOURNAL OF SURGERY
LA  - English
KW  - VIRTUAL-REALITY
KW  - TECHNICAL SKILL
KW  - PERFORMANCE
